# PoC PARSE-018 — a non-identifier label target gets the right diagnostic.
# `a + b:` used to throw ParserException(33) — the *catch-clause* message
# ("expected @atom after catch"). It now throws the dedicated label-target error.
# EXPECT: error: only an identifier can be used as a label

a := 1
b := 2

a + b: loop { break }
